{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026V5HzsaHP8P1794615140.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>英皇國際以近17億港元，出售英國一幢8層高商住物業。</p><p></p><p>物業位於倫敦沃德街，為一幢集合零售商舖、辦公物業及租賃式公寓的永久業權綜合性大樓，預期不會因出售物業確認任何收益或虧損。所得資金的七至九成，將用於償還銀行貸款，餘額用作物業發展及物業投資業務的營運資金。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T00:57:08.114275+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T23:41:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T08:15:31.988237+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T00:50:23.154457+00:00","content_hash":"56de5b10f072375f9316cad4026d5e48b9e676dcf544455ceeabbb4923654aac","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}